    "Content": "<div><span><span>In </span></span><span><span>late-January 2025</span><span>, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:&nbsp;</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></div><div><p></p><ul><li><span><span><span>&nbsp;Use database shrink to reduce </span><span>allocated</span><span>&nbsp;space in</span><span>&nbsp;the</span><span>&nbsp;Azure SQL Database Hyperscale</span><span>&nbsp;service tier</span><span>.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li></ul><div><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><a href=\"https://aka.ms/hs-shrink-ga\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span><span>.</span></span><br></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><p></p></div>",
    "Markdown": "In late-January 2025 , the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:\n\nUse database shrink to reduce allocated space in the Azure SQL Database Hyperscale service tier .\n\nLearn more ."
